   "Hyperscalers' AI-related capex remains largely insensitive to higher rates, with portfolio strategists expecting a healthy pace of investment in 2027.",
   "Persistently higher rates pose risks to equity prices, which could limit wealth effects and further dampen consumer spending by just under 0.5pp if markets remain flat.",
